<title>MEXICO: Bancomer merges bank, warehousing units.</title>
<headline>Bancomer merges bank, warehousing units.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Grupo Financiero Bancomer said on Monday it would merge its banking and warehousinig units.</p>
<p>Bancomer SA, Mexico's second-largest bank, will absorb Almanacenadora Bancomer SA de CV, the warehousing unit, the financial group said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;As a consequence of this merger, Bancomer acquires the overall ownership and ... all the assets and rights and assumes all the debts ... of Almacenadora Bancomer,&quot; the financial group said.</p>
<p>((--Daniel Perez-Whitaker, Monterrey bureau, +528 345-7617))</p>
